#X text 190 750 Yann Seznec 2022 // yannseznec.com;
#N canvas 126 299 614 318 what_is_this 0;
#X text 44 36 This patch makes a fun sound back at you in response to a sound.;
#X text 41 79 When a button is held down \, the audio input is recorded.;
#X text 39 110 As soon as the button is released \, the recording that was just made is played back.;
#X text 38 155 However instead of hearing the recording \, it is played back through a pitch detector and into a synth.;
#X text 42 204 enjoy!;
